         "comprehends": [
          "copies/tj337qh7786.jsonld#inscription-text"
         ],
         "note": "Ink, one sloping line. The date is plain: 21, 5 and a 1 with a narrow oval 0. Between the number and the name stands a single abbreviated letter with a descender and a crossbar, read as f. The name opens plainly Schiff and closes with one or two more letters, perhaps l or h, and a comma, which I cannot letter out."
        }
       ]
      }
